        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Medium Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese cabinet pulls run from 13-1/4 inches to 19-1/2 inches total length, just pick the size you need below. They are made out of long-lasting stainless steel with a satin finish for easy maintenance. All length of these modern satin stainless steel cabinet pulls are made out of 7/16 inch solid stainless steel and have a 1 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BPMD-specifications.gif?v=1704354592\" width=\"600\" height=\"367\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana Satin Stainless Steel Bar Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in <a href=\"/products/small-length-stainless-steel-bar-pulls-from-3-inches-7-5-inches-c-c-deltana-bpxxxxss\"><b>Small Lengths</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/large-length-stainless-steel-bar-pulls-from-21-inches-40-inches-c-c-deltana-bpxxxxss-lg\"><b>Large Lengths</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 7/16\" Diameter Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 7/16\" (12 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BPMD-Specifications.pdf?v=1691095333\"><b>Deltana Bar Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>BP1000SS: Overall Length 13-1/4\" - Center to Center 10\"</li>\r\n<li>BP1138SS: Overall Length 13-3/8\" - Center to Center 11-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>BP1250SS: Overall Length 15-3/4\" - Center to Center 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>BP1378SS: Overall Length 16-1/2\" - Center to Center 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>BP1637SS: Overall Length 19-1/2\" - Center to Center 16-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
